pcbkit 2

// BQ24075RGTR (Texas Instruments): the BQ24074RGTR's variant with SYSOFF on pin 15 (low: normal;
// high: the battery disconnected) and a fixed, current-based termination; otherwise the same chip,
// pins and land pattern (SLUS810N, table 7-1). From the BQ24074RGT part sheet.
// Single-cell Li-ion linear charger with power path (system
// output OUT at 5.5 V at most from the input, the battery behind it), 1.5 A charge, input 4.35-6.4
// V (26 V tolerant, 6.6 V OVP), USB 100/500 mA or resistor-set input limit, VQFN-16 3 x 3 mm
// (SLUS810N section 6, device comparison table: BQ24075 VOUT(REG) 5.5 V, VOVP 6.6 V)
// Compiled from the part sheet `parts/BQ24074RGT.json` (`parts.create`); status: checked.
// Datasheet: https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/bq24074.pdf (SLUS810N, revised October 2021)
// Pins: TI BQ2407x datasheet SLUS810N: Figure 7-2 and table 7-1 pin functions (BQ24074, RGT), 8.1
// absolute maximum ratings, 8.3 recommended operating conditions, 8.5 electrical characteristics,
// 10.2 design example, RGT0016C package outline
// Footprint: computed per IPC-7351B from the datasheet's package dimensions
// This file may be used, changed and shared without conditions, with the board or alone.

